    "THE generated architecture SHALL model the prototype as a one-shot processor and SHALL NOT use a workspace architecture or persistent database.",
    "WHEN validation, filtering, timeline construction, redaction, and rendering share event data, THE generated architecture SHALL define consistent domain contracts across those responsibilities.",
    "THE generated architecture SHALL preserve medium complexity through multiple commands and multiple output formats and SHALL NOT introduce a plugin system, global configuration, or cache.",
    "WHILE the CLI_Entrypoint handles an invocation, THE CLI_Entrypoint SHALL own argument parsing, help handling, domain invocation, rendering, stdout and stderr emission, and exit-code mapping without embedding the business rules of JSONL validation, filtering, timeline construction, or redaction.",
    "WHEN an internal operation succeeds, THE internal API SHALL return a logical result and SHALL NOT emit directly to stdout or stderr.",
